          "const": "Within each backend family, retain validation configurations with compression >=2x and prefer those passing every validation gate; if none pass, keep the family as a negative control. Minimize mean KL, with higher top-1 agreement, fewer bytes, and configuration ID as tie breakers. Test is run once."
